  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-4 mt-8">The Future of Disposable Email and Digital Privacy</h2>

  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    The future of disposable email is converging with edge computing, serverless architectures, and advanced privacy technologies. In the coming years, we can expect:
  </p>

  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 mb-4">
